IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehi! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Immagino di dovervi dare
il benvenuto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi stavo giusto
chiedendo quando sareste arrivati!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Kommt rein! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Macht's euch bequem!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hab mich schon gewundert, ob ihr
tatsächlich hier aufkreuzen würdet!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Look, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I asked you here for a good reason!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I borrowed this thing a while back,
but I forget whose it is!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Any chance
it's yours?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bak, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Seni buraya iyi bir sebeple çağırdım!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bir
süre önce bir şey ödünç aldım ama kimden
aldığımı unuttum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Acaba senin mi?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}You never change, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}You need to relax, dude.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I didn't call
you over for anything bad!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Remember that thing you wanted?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Well, I managed to snag one for ya!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Qué sabelotodo eres, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}A ver si te tomas las cosas con
más calma.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡Que no es para tanto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}A ver, ¿te acuerdas de la cosilla
aquella que querías?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Bueno, ¡pues
te he conseguido una para ti solito!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Toujours le mot qui fâche, hein,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mais t'inquiète, ton
heure a pas encore sonné.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}J'crois m'souvenir qu'y avait un truc
que tu voulais absolument,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} et vu
qu'on m'en a offert un, ben...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Non perdi occasione per fare
lo sbruffone, eh {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ti ho
fatto chiamare per un motivo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ti ricordi? C'era quella cosa che
volevi.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Beh, in qualche modo sono
riuscita a prenderla per te!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Haben wir heute wieder 'nen
Clown verschluckt, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Komm wieder runter!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Du wolltest doch, dass ich dir was
besorge, schon vergessen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ich hab's
endlich!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Sen hiç değişmiyorsun, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Rahatla biraz.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Seni kötü bir şey için çağırmadım!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Hani istediğin şey vardı ya?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Bir tane kapmayı başardım!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Eh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ne so qualcosa, sì{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} questa
storia è falsa!{{TAG:0003:002A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Perché lo so?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sono stato io ad avere l'idea!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Solo che non è piaciuta al fioraio!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Io avevo pensato a una gara
un po' più artistica.
Ognuno doveva dipingersi un fiore
di quelli che si trovano in {{TAG:0005:001E:00CD}}
sulla faccia{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dimmi che fiore ti piace e ti dirò
chi sei! Si dice così, no?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ah ah!

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Avete ancora bisogno di me?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Cioè,
non che non mi piaccia farvi felici
con la mia presenza, però...!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Comunque grazie, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dopo questo incontro, noi tre
saremo più vicini!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Vado, allora!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Se rimango ancora
qui, rischio di sciuparmi!{{TAG:0003:0020:}}
Divertitevi!
